    <section class="reflection" aria-labelledby="reflect-title">
      <h2 id="reflect-title">A short reflection</h2>
      <p>
        The poem ends on a funeral. If you want a few sentences: what would it
        take, in your own work, to sit with the person you have beaten and let
        the body of the quarrel be buried? The note stays in this browser.
      </p>
      <label class="reflection-label" for="note-pity">Your note</label>
